WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.500
A Chinese pilgrim arrives.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.200
And a whole monastery comes out

3
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.390
to meet him.

4
00:00:06.853 --> 00:00:08.713
Xuanzang reached Nalanda in the

5
00:00:08.713 --> 00:00:09.313
seventh century.

6
00:00:09.313 --> 00:00:11.693
His biographer Huili recorded

7
00:00:11.693 --> 00:00:13.753
the visit, and Samuel Beal

8
00:00:13.753 --> 00:00:15.763
translated it into English.

9
00:00:16.735 --> 00:00:18.675
Two hundred monks and about a

10
00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:20.675
thousand lay patrons walked him

11
00:00:20.675 --> 00:00:23.155
in, carrying banners, umbrellas

12
00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:24.225
and flowers.

13
00:00:24.881 --> 00:00:26.921
The head of the monastery was

14
00:00:26.921 --> 00:00:28.981
Shilabhadra. The monks so

15
00:00:28.981 --> 00:00:30.961
revered him that they would not

16
00:00:30.961 --> 00:00:32.061
