38
00:01:15.014 --> 00:01:17.044
Shilabhadra alone knew them all.

39
00:01:17.794 --> 00:01:19.694
The monks paid no fees.

40
00:01:19.694 --> 00:01:21.454
Villages supported the

41
00:01:21.454 --> 00:01:23.474
monastery. Even the guest's

42
00:01:23.474 --> 00:01:25.354
