45
00:01:32.439 --> 00:01:33.106
For GS1:

46
00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:35.439
Nalanda, the great Buddhist

47
00:01:35.439 --> 00:01:38.319
monastery of Magadha, seen by

48
00:01:38.319 --> 00:01:39.779
the Chinese pilgrim Xuanzang.

49
00:01:39.779 --> 00:01:43.359
About ten thousand monks, a wide

50
00:01:43.359 --> 00:01:45.499
